+# ADR-001: Meaning of 'who is clicking'
+
+Status: accepted
+
+## Decision
+Aggregate unique visitors from a pseudonymous daily hash
+
+## Rationale
+Answers the marketing question (reach) without processing identities; keeps the change inside privacy policy.
+
+## Alternatives
+- Store raw IPs (personal data; needs legal basis, DPIA, access controls)
+- Cookies/fingerprinting (consent requirements)
